I've recently been contemplating again the feasibility of a formal
semantics for (restricted parts of) lojban.

I (re)discovered Nick Nicholas' work from '93
http://www.lojban.org/files/papers/lojban_parser_paper
http://lojban.org/files/software/analyser
http://nuzban.wiw.org/archive/9303/msg00092.html=20

I was wondering: does anyone know if any more work along these lines was
ever done? Nick's work is mildly impressive as it stands, though quite
limited and written in a dialect of prolog which appears to be specific
to the NU-PROLOG implementation, the antiquated code for which I've
tried and failed to get compile on my modern linux machine...

Martin

